## 🔧 QUICK TIP: Using Find & Replace in GitHub Editor

1. Edit the file in GitHub
2. Press `Ctrl+F` (Windows) or `Cmd+F` (Mac)
3. Click the arrow to expand to Find & Replace
4. Enter placeholder in "Find" field
5. Enter replacement in "Replace" field
6. Click "Replace All"
7. Repeat for each placeholder

